r: Normal S1, S2, no murmurs.\n- Respiratory: Clear to auscultation bilaterally, no wheezing or crackles.\n- Abdomen: Soft, non-tender, no organomegaly.\n- Extremities: No edema, pulses 2+ bilaterally.\n- Neurological: Alert and oriented, no focal deficits.\n\nAdditional minor complaints included occasional dry eyes and mild fatigue, which the patient attributed to her ongoing cancer surveillance and exercise routine.\n\nDr. David Miller, MD\nOncologist, Gamble Group Clinic\n"
